  "description": "<p>This inspirational faith floral area rug offers a blend of comfort and spiritual decor for your home. Crafted with soft polyester fabric, it features an anti-slip backing for safety and can be personalized with a name or special message. Ideal for enhancing the atmosphere in various rooms, this rug serves as both a decorative piece and a meaningful accent.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design.</li>\n<li>Offers personalization with a name or text.</li>\n<li>Made with soft polyester fabric for comfort.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a variety of indoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant for lasting beauty.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Entryways, Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Offices, Gamer Rooms, Reading Nooks, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Christian, Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Name</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning or machine wash for deeper care.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile area rug is perfect for entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, and offices, adding a touch of inspirational decor. It also works well in gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, or as a decorative piece in a church, enhancing both comfort and spiritual ambiance.</p>",
